{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> is a psychological horror game set in an abandoned, haunted hospital. The player controls a young man who, after his death, becomes trapped in an alternate hospital. To return to the world of the living, he must solve mysterious tasks and endure mentally exhausting trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a slow-paced, atmospheric horror experience that focuses on psychological tension, oppressive ambiance, and environmental storytelling. There are no dialogues or human voices\u2014the story unfolds solely through the eerie environment, unsettling events, and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> \u2013 Pulls you into a dark and oppressive world, creating a constant sense of uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/Exittheabyss2025.05.04-00.33.20.01-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752147116\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Walking simulator with minimalist puzzles</strong> \u2013 No complex riddles; the game focuses on exploration and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalist yet haunting visuals</strong> \u2013 Enhances the feeling of isolation and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/Exit_the_abyss_steam_build_2025.03.022025.03.22-14.44.09.02-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752147116\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> \u2013 Hidden messages, ominous details, and disturbing events lead you toward the final resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Single-player, first-person horror</strong> \u2013 Combines liminal space aesthetics with psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy psychological horror and liminal space games like <i>Layers of Fear, SOMA, The Stanley Parable, The Exit 8, Paratopic, Anemoiapolis,</i> or <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, then <strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> will be a perfect choice for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518110?t=1752147116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/f9804f19de692c3885f1abd2f9776319fd06fec8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752147116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/37f44be9c0c63c6cfae523ded75869630bfd403c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752147116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/37f44be9c0c63c6cfae523ded75869630bfd403c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752147116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains strong psychological horror elements, including a disturbing atmosphere, jump scares, and stress-inducing sound effects. The story revolves around a state between life and death, which may cause anxiety and discomfort for sensitive players. The game does not contain extreme violence, gore, sexual content, or scenes depicting self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> is a psychological horror game set in an abandoned, haunted hospital. The player controls a young man who, after his death, becomes trapped in an alternate hospital. To return to the world of the living, he must solve mysterious tasks and endure mentally exhausting trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a slow-paced, atmospheric horror experience that focuses on psychological tension, oppressive ambiance, and environmental storytelling. There are no dialogues or human voices\u2014the story unfolds solely through the eerie environment, unsettling events, and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> \u2013 Pulls you into a dark and oppressive world, creating a constant sense of uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/Exittheabyss2025.05.04-00.33.20.01-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752147116\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Walking simulator with minimalist puzzles</strong> \u2013 No complex riddles; the game focuses on exploration and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalist yet haunting visuals</strong> \u2013 Enhances the feeling of isolation and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/Exit_the_abyss_steam_build_2025.03.022025.03.22-14.44.09.02-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752147116\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> \u2013 Hidden messages, ominous details, and disturbing events lead you toward the final resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Single-player, first-person horror</strong> \u2013 Combines liminal space aesthetics with psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy psychological horror and liminal space games like <i>Layers of Fear, SOMA, The Stanley Parable, The Exit 8, Paratopic, Anemoiapolis,</i> or <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, then <strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> will be a perfect choice for you!</p>","developers":["Veloneer Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam